  - still: {fileID: 2800000, guid: ac9c33c1e928167c79fe8e580e38f6ef, type: 3}
    video: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
    seconds: 2
    panFrom: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 1}
    panTo: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 1}
    speaker: STEVENS
    lineId: cs01_00
    text: Lucy.
  - still: {fileID: 2800000, guid: ac9c33c1e928167c79fe8e580e38f6ef, type: 3}
    video: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
    seconds: 2.19
    panFrom: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 1}
    panTo: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 1}
    speaker: STEVENS
    lineId: cs01_01
    text: Your name is Lucy.
  - still: {fileID: 2800000, guid: ac9c33c1e928167c79fe8e580e38f6ef, type: 3}
    video: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
    seconds: 4.775
    panFrom: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 1}
    panTo: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 1}
    speaker: STEVENS
    lineId: cs01_02
    text: You're confused. You're dizzy. That's normal, and I can't fix it.
  - still: {fileID: 2800000, guid: ac9c33c1e928167c79fe8e580e38f6ef, type: 3}
    video: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
    seconds: 2.74
    panFrom: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 1}
    panTo: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 1}
    speaker: STEVENS
    lineId: cs01_03
    text: Neither of us has much time.
  - still: {fileID: 2800000, guid: ac9c33c1e928167c79fe8e580e38f6ef, type: 3}
    video: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
    seconds: 4.225
    panFrom: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 1}
    panTo: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 1}
    speaker: STEVENS
    lineId: cs01_04
    text: I can't open that frame from here. Nobody can, tonight.
  - still: {fileID: 2800000, guid: ac9c33c1e928167c79fe8e580e38f6ef, type: 3}
    video: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
    seconds: 2
    panFrom: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 1}
    panTo: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 1}
    speaker: STEVENS
    lineId: cs01_05
    text: You can.
  - still: {fileID: 2800000, guid: ac9c33c1e928167c79fe8e580e38f6ef, type: 3}
    video: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
    seconds: 5.05
    panFrom: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 1}
    panTo: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 1}
    speaker: STEVENS
    lineId: cs01_06
    text: When you're out, there's an office. There's a printer. Take the sheet.
  - still: {fileID: 2800000, guid: ac9c33c1e928167c79fe8e580e38f6ef, type: 3}
    video: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
    seconds: 6
    panFrom: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 1}
    panTo: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 1}
    speaker: STEVENS
    lineId: cs01_07
    text: The part in red. Nobody's finished it. There are no cameras in there. I'll
      make sure it's empty.
  - still: {fileID: 2800000, guid: ac9c33c1e928167c79fe8e580e38f6ef, type: 3}
    video: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
    seconds: 4.335
    panFrom: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 1}
    panTo: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 1}
    speaker: STEVENS
    lineId: cs01_08
    text: I can't walk you there. You'll have to find your own way.
